{"id":"n21770-1-7","stage":4,"title":"건기 · 旱季","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n21770-1-7-1","ko":"더운데 비나 내렸으면 좋겠다.","zh":"天气这么热，要是能下雨就好了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"더운데","meaning":"热，暑","explanation":"덥다：热，暑；은데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"덥다","audio":"/audio/038a0682ef015c0a8e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44484","senseId":"1","lemma":"덥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더운데","audio":"/audio/6a4a31748d07da622588.mp3"}},{"text":"비나","meaning":"雨","explanation":"비：雨；나：连接可以选择的名词，表示“或、或者”。","readings":[{"term":"비","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36681","senseId":"1","lemma":"비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비나","audio":"/audio/f765e94075c3a2650d2a.mp3"}},{"text":"내렸으면","meaning":"下，落","explanation":"내리다：下，落；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；으면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"내리다","audio":"/audio/01d776172b3f93c3c9d5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73353","senseId":"1","lemma":"내리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내렸으면","audio":"/audio/bc46ec44a0dd312db780.mp3"}},{"text":"좋겠다.","meaning":"好，晴朗，明媚","explanation":"좋다：好，晴朗，明媚；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"6","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋겠다","audio":"/audio/662bbd805e871b1915e9.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"038a0682ef015c0a","term":"덥다","zh":"热，暑","audio":"/audio/038a0682ef015c0a8e45.mp3","entryId":"44484","definition":"体感气温高。","pronunciation":["덥ː따"]},{"id":"5e0d62698b44a434","term":"비","zh":"雨","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3","entryId":"36681","definition":"高空中形成云朵的水蒸气冷却凝聚后降落而下的水滴。","pronunciation":["비"]},{"id":"01d776172b3f93c3","term":"내리다","zh":"下，落","audio":"/audio/01d776172b3f93c3c9d5.mp3","entryId":"73353","definition":"雪或雨等降下。","pronunciation":["내리다"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，晴朗，明媚","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"天气风和日丽。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/839d350b541733c2de7c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n21770-1-7-2","ko":"지금은 건기라서 비가 잘 안 와.","zh":"现在正处于旱季，所以不太会下雨。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지금은","meaning":"现在","explanation":"지금：现在；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62522","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지금은","audio":"/audio/981101a536ceceb06592.mp3"}},{"text":"건기라서","meaning":"旱季，干季","explanation":"건기：旱季，干季；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라서：名词判断或 아니다 后的原因表达：“因为是、因为不是”。","readings":[{"term":"건기","audio":"/audio/69f5dbde24b5aee04029.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"21770","senseId":"1","lemma":"건기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"건기라서","audio":"/audio/7a80234ef6e05082faba.mp3"}},{"text":"비가","meaning":"雨","explanation":"비：雨；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"비","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36681","senseId":"1","lemma":"비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비가","audio":"/audio/34e7530f1cc9ef8588ee.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"经常","explanation":"잘：经常","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"9","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"와.","meaning":"下，来","explanation":"오다：下，来；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。",